Cohabi Cut timeline port: attribution

This directory contains code ported and adapted from OpenCut classic:
  https://github.com/OpenCut-app/opencut-classic
  fork point (pinned commit): cf5e79e919144200294fb9fed22a222592a0aeea
  (archived, read-only, MIT licensed)

Files ported from classic's apps/web/src:
  commands/timeline/element/split-elements.ts  -> ops.mjs (splitElements)
  ripple/{apply,diff,shift}.ts                 -> ops.mjs (ripple)
  timeline/update-pipeline.ts                  -> model.mjs (applyElementUpdate)
  wasm/media-time.ts (MediaTime, reimplemented) -> time.mjs
  timeline/{scale,pixel-utils}.ts, snapping/threshold.ts, retime/{resolve,split,rate}.ts -> time.mjs

Written fresh here, not copied (behaviour is ours): snapping resolve, trim,
scenes, animations stand-in, factories.

